data: {"id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2-thinking-parallel_evidence-413", "run_id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": ".", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789118419740, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2-thinking-parallel_evidence-414", "run_id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Based on the real-time evidence collected for `aiops-case-v04/workload`:\n\n**Root Cause:**\nThe Pod is stuck in `ContainerCreating` due to a **`FailedMount`** event caused by a missing Secret. The Kubernetes scheduler has successfully assigned the Pod to `node2`, but the Kubelet cannot start the container because the volume `input` (which references `SecretName: unavailable-input`) does not exist in the `aiops-case-v04` namespace.\n\n**Supporting Facts:**\n*   **Events:** `kubectl describe` shows rep", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789118419772, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2", "seq": 415, "ts_ms": 1789118423678, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 28.291, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v04", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2bf9c7e48b184ba2-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "a9458287003fb17cc7d918edf0f0c2659c262585cb0e84ff0c85643c49dc07a1", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "8fe11b4e074e02b5d35cd33e45417a16f00b8c3894c486f45f0016631e291998"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2", "seq": 416, "ts_ms": 1789118423679, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2", "seq": 417, "ts_ms": 1789118433867, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.188, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1700, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Volume mount failure due to missing Secret 'unavailable-input' |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount` - `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` (fact-1c604d9c3cc7) | 指出容器挂载卷时因 Secret 不存在而失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `timed out waiting for the condition` (fact-671e7ab2535d) | 描述 kubelet 因依赖资源缺失导致的超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `containers with unready status: [app]` (fact-2d1d7577f19e) | 直接状态：应用容器不可用 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `phase: Pending` (fact-6a5a1e206578) | Pod 处于挂起状态，无法调度至运行期 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1，标签 `reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-076f3856d195) | 确认应用容器处于等待状态，验证了异常现象 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | CPU Limit: 50m, Memory Limit: 32Mi (fact-6a5a1e206578) | 排除资源限制导致容器启动缓慢的可能性 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. Kubernetes Event (fact-1c604d9c3cc7) 明确指出 `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found`，这是导致 `FailedMount` 的直接原因。\n2. 状态 `Pending` (fact-6a5a1e206578) 与等待原因 `ContainerCreating` (fact-076f3856d195) 互相印证，表明容器因前置依赖（Secret）缺失而无法进入 `Running` 阶段。\n3. 资源配置（Fact-6a5a1e206578, Fact-8fe49f8c0258）正常，排除资源不足导致的调度失败或 OOM。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 Secret 'unavailable-input' → 挂载卷失败 (FailedMount) → 容器状态为 ContainerCreating → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod 中挂载卷 `input` 所需的 Secret `unavailable-input` 不存在于集群中，导致 kubelet 挂载失败 (K8s Event, fact-1c604d9c3cc7)。这直接导致应用容器 `app` 无法启动，始终停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (Metric, fact-076f3856d195)，进而使 Pod 整体处于 `Pending` 状态 (K8s State, fact-6a5a1e206578)。\n\n证据充分，无需进一步排查。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Volume mount failure due to missing Secret 'unavailable-input' |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount` - `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` (fact-1c604d9c3cc7) | 指出容器挂载卷时因 Secret 不存在而失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `timed out waiting for the condition` (fact-671e7ab2535d) | 描述 kubelet 因依赖资源缺失导致的超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `containers with unready status: [app]` (fact-2d1d7577f19e) | 直接状态：应用容器不可用 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `phase: Pending` (fact-6a5a1e206578) | Pod 处于挂起状态，无法调度至运行期 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1，标签 `reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-076f3856d195) | 确认应用容器处于等待状态，验证了异常现象 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | CPU Limit: 50m, Memory Limit: 32Mi (fact-6a5a1e206578) | 排除资源限制导致容器启动缓慢的可能性 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. Kubernetes Event (fact-1c604d9c3cc7) 明确指出 `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found`，这是导致 `FailedMount` 的直接原因。\n2. 状态 `Pending` (fact-6a5a1e206578) 与等待原因 `ContainerCreating` (fact-076f3856d195) 互相印证，表明容器因前置依赖（Secret）缺失而无法进入 `Running` 阶段。\n3. 资源配置（Fact-6a5a1e206578, Fact-8fe49f8c0258）正常，排除资源不足导致的调度失败或 OOM。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 Secret 'unavailable-input' → 挂载卷失败 (FailedMount) → 容器状态为 ContainerCreating → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod 中挂载卷 `input` 所需的 Secret `unavailable-input` 不存在于集群中，导致 kubelet 挂载失败 (K8s Event, fact-1c604d9c3cc7)。这直接导致应用容器 `app` 无法启动，始终停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (Metric, fact-076f3856d195)，进而使 Pod 整体处于 `Pending` 状态 (K8s State, fact-6a5a1e206578)。\n\n证据充分，无需进一步排查。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2-final", "run_id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2", "seq": 419, "ts_ms": 1789118433883, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Volume mount failure due to missing Secret 'unavailable-input' |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount` - `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` (fact-1c604d9c3cc7) | 指出容器挂载卷时因 Secret 不存在而失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `timed out waiting for the condition` (fact-671e7ab2535d) | 描述 kubelet 因依赖资源缺失导致的超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `containers with unready status: [app]` (fact-2d1d7577f19e) | 直接状态：应用容器不可用 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `phase: Pending` (fact-6a5a1e206578) | Pod 处于挂起状态，无法调度至运行期 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1，标签 `reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-076f3856d195) | 确认应用容器处于等待状态，验证了异常现象 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | CPU Limit: 50m, Memory Limit: 32Mi (fact-6a5a1e206578) | 排除资源限制导致容器启动缓慢的可能性 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. Kubernetes Event (fact-1c604d9c3cc7) 明确指出 `secret \"unavailable-input\" not found`，这是导致 `FailedMount` 的直接原因。\n2. 状态 `Pending` (fact-6a5a1e206578) 与等待原因 `ContainerCreating` (fact-076f3856d195) 互相印证，表明容器因前置依赖（Secret）缺失而无法进入 `Running` 阶段。\n3. 资源配置（Fact-6a5a1e206578, Fact-8fe49f8c0258）正常，排除资源不足导致的调度失败或 OOM。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 Secret 'unavailable-input' → 挂载卷失败 (FailedMount) → 容器状态为 ContainerCreating → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod 中挂载卷 `input` 所需的 Secret `unavailable-input` 不存在于集群中，导致 kubelet 挂载失败 (K8s Event, fact-1c604d9c3cc7)。这直接导致应用容器 `app` 无法启动，始终停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (Metric, fact-076f3856d195)，进而使 Pod 整体处于 `Pending` 状态 (K8s State, fact-6a5a1e206578)。\n\n证据充分，无需进一步排查。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 58.0s\n├─ 问题定位: 19.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 28.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v04/workload: 28.3s (Evidence 24.4s, RCA 3.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v04/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 57.971, "metrics": {"run_id": "2bf9c7e48b184ba2", "mttr": {"value": "58.0s", "seconds": 57.973308086395264, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 57973.308086395264, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 53193.679332733154, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 11266.347408294